note 06_largest_three.vss — Find Largest of Three Numbers
task find_largest needs a, b, c
    when a at_least b and a at_least c
        send a
    orwhen b at_least a and b at_least c
        send b
    otherwise
        send c
    finish
finish

say "Largest of 10, 25, 15 is: " + find_largest(10, 25, 15)
say "Largest of 99, 12, 45 is: " + find_largest(99, 12, 45)
